nity.\n\nSupported Boards\n• Balkna Summit\n• Beastmaker 1000\n• Beastmaker 2000\n• Crusher Megarail\n• eGUrre Hangboard\n• Kraxlboard Rock\n• Linebreaker BASE\n• Metolius Project\n• Metolius Simulator 3D\n• Strong Ant III\n• Power Ant Mini\n• Unlimited Board\n• WhiteOak Hangboard\n• WhiteOak Portable\n• WOOD BOARD\n• WOOD BOARD hobby\n• WOOD BOARD profi\n• Wood Grips Compact II\n• Wood Grips Deluxe II\n• Workshop 19/50 Ergo\n• Zlagboard Pro 2.0\n• 2Climb Crimp Travel\n• 2Climb Crux\n• 2Climb Gamechanger\n...and more are coming. \n\nCannot see your board on the list? Let us know at support@fingy.app.\n\nWould you like to become a fingy climber too? Strengthen your grip anywhere you mount your hangboard - and take your phone. Fingy will help you get a bit closer.", "averageUserRating": 5, "minimumOsVersion": "12.0", "trackCensoredName": "Fingy", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/fingy/id1511136562?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "bundleId": "com.forcandies.fingy", "primaryGenreName": "Sports", "primaryGenreId": 6004, "trackId": 1511136562, "trackName": "Fingy", "userRatingCount": 1}]}